      "descriptions": {
        "shortDescriptionText": "<p>Located in the Tomorrowland Pavilion, Pixar Adventurous Journey is the first immersive and interactive Pixar movie-themed exhibition in China. This narrative-driven walkthrough exhibition will guide guests through seven playfully designed worlds and bring iconic tales to life in one unforgettable experience, inviting guests to connect with all the heartfelt moments while journeying with the warmth, courage, inspiration and power that Pixar stories have provided with their family and friends.</p>\n<p>— Dawn of Consciousness - Inside Out\n<br />\n· Personified emotions illuminate the awakening of the mind at life's inception.\n<br />\n— Age of Innocence - Monsters, Inc.\n<br />\n· Monstrous realms interacting with children reveal the essence of purity.\n<br />\n— Awakening of Selfhood - Finding Nemo\n<br />\n· Nemo's oceanic odyssey metaphorically charts the emergence of individual identity.\n<br />\n— Growing Pains - Turning Red\n<br />\n· Shape-shifting fantasy visualizes adolescent psychological metamorphosis.\n<br />\n— Legacy of Dreams - Coco\n<br />\n· Musical pursuits deepen understanding of familial bonds and love's endurance.\n<br />\n— Bonds of Affection - Up\n<br />\n· A floating house voyage explores a magical journey to discover love.\n<br />\n— Soul Actualization - Soul\n<br />\n· Spirit world constructs decode life's ultimate meaning through existential inquiry.</p>",
        "shortDescriptionMobileText": "<p>Located in the Tomorrowland Pavilion, Pixar Adventurous Journey is the first immersive and interactive Pixar movie-themed exhibition in China. This narrative-driven walkthrough exhibition will guide guests through seven playfully designed worlds and bring iconic tales to life in one unforgettable experience, inviting guests to connect with all the heartfelt moments while journeying with the warmth, courage, inspiration and power that Pixar stories have provided with their family and friends.</p>\n<p>— Dawn of Consciousness - Inside Out\n<br/>\n· Personified emotions illuminate the awakening of the mind at life's inception.\n<br/>\n— Age of Innocence - Monsters, Inc.\n<br/>\n· Monstrous realms interacting with children reveal the essence of purity.\n<br/>\n— Awakening of Selfhood - Finding Nemo\n<br/>\n· Nemo's oceanic odyssey metaphorically charts the emergence of individual identity.\n<br/>\n— Growing Pains - Turning Red\n<br/>\n· Shape-shifting fantasy visualizes adolescent psychological metamorphosis.\n<br/>\n— Legacy of Dreams - Coco\n<br/>\n· Musical pursuits deepen understanding of familial bonds and love's endurance.\n<br/>\n— Bonds of Affection - Up\n<br/>\n· A floating house voyage explores a magical journey to discover love.\n<br/>\n— Soul Actualization - Soul\n<br/>\n· Spirit world constructs decode life's ultimate meaning through existential inquiry.</p>"
      },
